    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9254" root="حن" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْنُونٌ</span></b> , applied to a man, (S, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْنُونٌ</span>
[properly <i>Possessed by a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِنِّىّ</span>; and hence, <i>mad,</i>
or <i>insane</i>]: (S, K: [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحِنُّ</span>:]) or <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصْرُوعٌ</span>
[as meaning <i>affected with epilepsy</i>]: (K:) or
one <i>who is affected with epilepsy</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُصْرَعُ</span>) <i>and then
revives for a time.</i> (AA, TA.)

